    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d855">

                <pb facs="0876" n="864" sameAs="frus:frus1941v02/pg864"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.4016/264: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gunther</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-07-01T19:00:00+02:00">July 1, 1941—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 2—11:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>599. An official announcement published today states that 500 Jews have been put
                    to death in Iasi for having fired from buildings upon <pb facs="0877" n="865"
                        xml:id="pg865"/> the German and Rumanian troops. It is also stated that Jews
                    behind the Rumanian front are collaborating with Russian parachutists and that
                    severe repressive measures are being adopted; also that persons who do not
                    divulge information regarding strangers or other suspects to the authorities
                    will be executed together with their families.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gunther</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
